      "content": "that's a good start. it definitely sounds more professional than the original.\n\ni just ran it through a test version of the scanner and the coverage score is okay, but not great—it missed a few of the technical terms like Kubernetes and scalability in the right context, and the flow feels a little bit like a list of sentences.\n\ncan you try to push that coverage score as high as possible? i need it to be near 1.0. just please, please don't fall into the trap of just dumping the keywords in a 'skills' block at the end. the recruiter's eyes will catch that immediately and it'll look like a bot wrote it. try to weave every single one of those terms into the actual narrative of their career so it hits 100% coverage while still feeling like a high-level executive bio.",
